---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import headshot from '../assets/images/headshot.webp';
---

<section class="bg-cream-100 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl items-center gap-10 px-6 md:grid-cols-5 md:gap-16">
    <div class="flex justify-center md:col-span-2">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gold-500/20 to-cream-200"></div>
        <Image
          src={headshot}
          alt="Christina Beaumier professional headshot"
          class="relative h-72 w-72 rounded-2xl object-cover object-top shadow-lg sm:h-80 sm:w-80"
          widths={[288, 320, 576, 640]}
          sizes="(max-width: 640px) 288px, 320px"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-3">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-warm-gray-900 sm:text-5xl">
        Christina Beaumier
      </h1>
      <blockquote class="mt-4 border-l-2 border-gold-500 pl-4 font-serif text-lg italic text-warm-gray-600 sm:text-xl">
        "Across roles and industries, Christina Beaumier carries out her mission with purpose and bravery, navigating a path to solutions to the toughest problems."
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-warm-gray-600">Product and Tech Leader, General Manager | Ex-Microsoft/Google/AT&amp;T | MIT MBA</p>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-warm-gray-700">
        <p>
          With over 15 years of experience in the enterprise tech industry, Christina has a proven track record of building and transforming products that harness the power of data and disrupt market norms.
        </p>
        <p>
          As the SVP Product and Technology at Xandr (acquired by Microsoft in 2022), she led the product and technology strategy, vision, and operations for multiple business lines. She directly managed a 100 person cross-functional team of Product, Design, Engineering, Customer Success, and Product Marketing as the single-threaded general manager.
        </p>
        <p>
          Christina also has extensive experience in architecting M&amp;A integrations and piloting startups, having driven the technology-related process and synergy of the deal to acquire AppNexus, and the business case and integration for Clypd, both of which became part of Xandr.
        </p>
        <p>
          Continuously learning, Christina obtained a Certificate in AI and Machine Learning from MIT in 2023. She has an MBA from MIT Sloan School of Management and lives with her husband and their two children who are growing up too fast in Brooklyn, NY.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/christinabeaumier/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-gold-500 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-gold-600"
      >
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
        </svg>
        Connect on LinkedIn
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
